# Radix ships its primitives as many small packages that the components reach
# through peer-ish transitive paths; hoisting them keeps a single copy of each
# in the tree instead of one per consumer.
#
# The @storybook/* and ts-dedent patterns that used to sit here went with
# Storybook itself - the .storybook config is gone, and nothing imported either.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@radix-ui/*
